<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφήκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκή</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>two-edged,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσγανον, ξίφος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.256
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				10.87
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντρον, δόρυ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				692
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1149
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχος, γένυς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				286
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				485
			</span></i>; of lightning, <i>forked,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὸς ἀ. βόστρυχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1044
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραυνός</span> Cleanth.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. γλῶττα</span> tongue <i>that will
				cut both ways,</i> i.e. maintain either right or wrong, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1160
			</span></i> (parod.); of an oracle, <i>ambiguous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ διπρόσωπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>JTr.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
